{"id":46611,"date":"2022-03-09T22:32:17","date_gmt":"2022-03-10T03:32:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/?p=46611"},"modified":"2022-03-09T22:32:17","modified_gmt":"2022-03-10T03:32:17","slug":"state-of-play-du-9-mars-2022-un-apercu","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/state-of-play-du-9-mars-2022-un-apercu\/","title":{"rendered":"State of Play du 9 mars 2022: un aper\u00e7u"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><b>Voici un r\u00e9sum\u00e9 des annonces faites pendant le State of Play pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 par Sony aujourd\u2019hui.<\/b><\/p>\n<h6>(Cr\u00e9dit image: Luminous Productions)<\/h6>\n<h2>Exoprimal<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Exoprimal est un nouveau FPS dans lequel le joueur combat contre des dinosaures. Il est pr\u00e9vu pour 2023.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/PXmsffSibbg?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Ghostwire Tokyo<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ghostwire Tokyo est un nouveau jeu d\u2019horreur cr\u00e9\u00e9 au Japon qui est pr\u00e9vu pour le 25 mars prochain. On a eu droit \u00e0 une nouvelle bande-annonce pour le jeu durant cette pr\u00e9sentation.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/wPTX1I2pKeA?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Stranger of Paradise: Final Fantasy Origin<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Une nouvelle d\u00e9mo est disponible d\u00e8s aujourd&rsquo;hui, le jeu sortira le 18 mars 2022.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/1C-maLQ4hvk?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Forspoken<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Forspoken est un nouveau jeu d\u2019action-RPG \u00e9dit\u00e9 par Square Enix. La sortie est repouss\u00e9e au 11octobre 2022.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/y8f8QZTOrfk?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>The Diofield Chronicle<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Square Enix annonce the Diofield Chronicle, un nouveau jeu de r\u00f4le tactique pr\u00e9vu en 2022.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/a_Jnap7qQK8?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Valkyrie Elysium<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Le 4e \u00e9pisode de la s\u00e9rie d\u2019action-RPG est annonc\u00e9 par Square Enix et pr\u00e9vu en 2022.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Ve_JJ5uH72A?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Gundam Evolution<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Gundam Evolution est un nouveau jeu FPS multijoueur qui pousse les joueurs \u00e0 s\u2019affronter \u00e0 6 contre 6.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-3-EXtjXo3U?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Cowabunga Collection<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Une toute nouvelle collection de jeux Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles arrive en 2022.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/R-78FD9xvc0?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>GigaBash<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">GigaBash est un nouveau jeu de combat et d\u2019action o\u00f9 on fait combattre des Kaiju (cr\u00e9atures g\u00e9antes). Le jeu est pr\u00e9vu en 2022.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/L5NMQyfyX9s?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Jojo&rsquo;s Bizare Adventure: All Star Battle<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Un nouveau jeu de combat dans l\u2019univers du manga Jojo\u2019s Bizare Adventure pr\u00e9vu pour l\u2019automne 2022.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/ejbTkRThQtg?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2>Trek to Yomi<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Trek to Yomi est un nouveau jeu d\u2019action-aventure en noir et blanc prenant place au Japon pr\u00e9vu pour le printemps 2022.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com